{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birders, assemble!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We've developed a cozy idle game just for you. Now, you can enjoy birdwatching from the comfort of your desktop, too! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place your postcard \u2014 a window to another world \u2014 right at the corner of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your favourite birding spot to your heart's content. If a bird happens to fancy your humble abode, it just might stop by for a visit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join us on Discord!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/842c133279bb6a832785420affc28c9f.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock a variety of birding spots! The docks, beaches, deserts, even rainforests\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each place has its own unique scenery, and new bird species to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/147af5572ccea30b6096d43345155ac6.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/147af5572ccea30b6096d43345155ac6.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/147af5572ccea30b6096d43345155ac6.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/6406b6bb7f5e988de39d48b5d3bbad47.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>Your Birding Area can be freely manipulated! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Zoom, move, and arrange your favourite birding spot however you like </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2014 the birds will keep you company while you work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Blueprint System is now live!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can save your builds, share them, and quickly switch between different designs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f685825bca5d31a1922785617d3afa36.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f685825bca5d31a1922785617d3afa36.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f685825bca5d31a1922785617d3afa36.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2eccc13f62de53ba1fc3920bdd5be4c0.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sparrows aren't the only birds that want to hang out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are dozens of other bird species, too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They have their own preferred times to visit \u2014 maybe you can capture something wonderful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The more a bird visits, the more comfortable they'll feel! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You might be able to discover new behaviors over time\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/94367db7b5daf165c1c7f5c7d0fbf489.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/94367db7b5daf165c1c7f5c7d0fbf489.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/94367db7b5daf165c1c7f5c7d0fbf489.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c36e13f70be9829da776e7ffff36c44.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>Snap! Immortalize your favourite moments with your camera. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you've documented every unique behavior from a bird, you'll earn a statue of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5bd8ca5957edc8a7ab72f8ffa1ea81b2.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5bd8ca5957edc8a7ab72f8ffa1ea81b2.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5bd8ca5957edc8a7ab72f8ffa1ea81b2.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f2f7f0ee147be1499a56181fb49ad972.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f2f7f0ee147be1499a56181fb49ad972.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f2f7f0ee147be1499a56181fb49ad972.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2beb3573f2cf07d14881317440a36e66.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>Any new lifers today?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your handbook also keeps a record of Birding Areas, decoration, photographs, achievements, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cd53d1c506d539383471866d285fb8a6.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cd53d1c506d539383471866d285fb8a6.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cd53d1c506d539383471866d285fb8a6.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you enlarge the main illustration, you'll be able to discover just what traits make that bird special!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2f184713cdcde9b90daddd59e7710319.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2f184713cdcde9b90daddd59e7710319.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2f184713cdcde9b90daddd59e7710319.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b57eade0585864caf56b0673eec34484.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>You can change the time of day and weather of your Birding Area as you desire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Regardless of time, or weather, you'll meet a new friend who enjoys it, that's for sure!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In the night, nocturnal birds await\u2026<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/4975c6b92ad4d227c9f97ae3e02f3d20.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/4975c6b92ad4d227c9f97ae3e02f3d20.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/4975c6b92ad4d227c9f97ae3e02f3d20.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/23b64d3b79bff07cf8e66b738a5540bb.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your bird friends will bring all sorts of trinkets for you to collect! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They'll drop all sorts of colorful feathers, and maybe more\u2026<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5a98e5e473a02c596752af5a51018f91.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boss Crow loves anything that sparkles \u2014 whether it be shimmering feathers, or the bright glint of bottle caps! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He'll return the favor in Crow Coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>More features are under development: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>you'll be able to share gorgeous birding spots with your friends, and more\u2026</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111370?t=1774646754","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/afa4f4c0671a11a9df0b4aceebaaecafca51432c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774646754","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/d4a71423180ba0a3dd7a4cdb000a4df30207cc76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774646754","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/d4a71423180ba0a3dd7a4cdb000a4df30207cc76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774646754","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4209250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birders, assemble!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We've developed a cozy idle game just for you. Now, you can enjoy birdwatching from the comfort of your desktop, too! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place your postcard \u2014 a window to another world \u2014 right at the corner of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your favourite birding spot to your heart's content. If a bird happens to fancy your humble abode, it just might stop by for a visit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join us on Discord!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/842c133279bb6a832785420affc28c9f.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock a variety of birding spots! The docks, beaches, deserts, even rainforests\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each place has its own unique scenery, and new bird species to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/147af5572ccea30b6096d43345155ac6.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/147af5572ccea30b6096d43345155ac6.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/147af5572ccea30b6096d43345155ac6.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/6406b6bb7f5e988de39d48b5d3bbad47.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>Your Birding Area can be freely manipulated! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Zoom, move, and arrange your favourite birding spot however you like </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2014 the birds will keep you company while you work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Blueprint System is now live!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can save your builds, share them, and quickly switch between different designs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f685825bca5d31a1922785617d3afa36.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f685825bca5d31a1922785617d3afa36.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f685825bca5d31a1922785617d3afa36.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2eccc13f62de53ba1fc3920bdd5be4c0.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sparrows aren't the only birds that want to hang out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are dozens of other bird species, too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They have their own preferred times to visit \u2014 maybe you can capture something wonderful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The more a bird visits, the more comfortable they'll feel! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You might be able to discover new behaviors over time\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/94367db7b5daf165c1c7f5c7d0fbf489.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/94367db7b5daf165c1c7f5c7d0fbf489.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/94367db7b5daf165c1c7f5c7d0fbf489.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c36e13f70be9829da776e7ffff36c44.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>Snap! Immortalize your favourite moments with your camera. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you've documented every unique behavior from a bird, you'll earn a statue of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5bd8ca5957edc8a7ab72f8ffa1ea81b2.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5bd8ca5957edc8a7ab72f8ffa1ea81b2.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5bd8ca5957edc8a7ab72f8ffa1ea81b2.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f2f7f0ee147be1499a56181fb49ad972.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f2f7f0ee147be1499a56181fb49ad972.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f2f7f0ee147be1499a56181fb49ad972.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2beb3573f2cf07d14881317440a36e66.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>Any new lifers today?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your handbook also keeps a record of Birding Areas, decoration, photographs, achievements, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cd53d1c506d539383471866d285fb8a6.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cd53d1c506d539383471866d285fb8a6.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cd53d1c506d539383471866d285fb8a6.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you enlarge the main illustration, you'll be able to discover just what traits make that bird special!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2f184713cdcde9b90daddd59e7710319.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2f184713cdcde9b90daddd59e7710319.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2f184713cdcde9b90daddd59e7710319.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b57eade0585864caf56b0673eec34484.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span>You can change the time of day and weather of your Birding Area as you desire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Regardless of time, or weather, you'll meet a new friend who enjoys it, that's for sure!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In the night, nocturnal birds await\u2026<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/4975c6b92ad4d227c9f97ae3e02f3d20.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/4975c6b92ad4d227c9f97ae3e02f3d20.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/4975c6b92ad4d227c9f97ae3e02f3d20.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/23b64d3b79bff07cf8e66b738a5540bb.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your bird friends will bring all sorts of trinkets for you to collect! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They'll drop all sorts of colorful feathers, and maybe more\u2026<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5a98e5e473a02c596752af5a51018f91.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boss Crow loves anything that sparkles \u2014 whether it be shimmering feathers, or the bright glint of bottle caps! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He'll return the favor in Crow Coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.poster.avif?t=1774646754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.webm?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.mp4?t=1774646754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>More features are under development: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>you'll be able to share gorgeous birding spots with your friends, and more\u2026</strong></p>","developers":["Biekka Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/8d63617f6ba762697b5658a20453e5342cc58a03/header.jpg?t=1774646754","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any Intel or Apple Silicon processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111370/774636597/2981b4c5baedce4fd9ba2b8e3b5e3fd49c1c7d5b/1772791803/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772792850","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111370/774636597/2981b4c5baedce4fd9ba2b8e3b5e3fd49c1c7d5b/1772791803/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772792850","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111